{"title":"Career Roadmap · Ethics Consultant","role":"Ethics Consultant","summary":"An Ethics Consultant helps organisations identify, analyse, and manage ethical issues in business decisions, technology, governance, healthcare, research, public policy, and professional practice. The role combines philosophy + applied ethics + critical reasoning + policy + stakeholder analysis + risk management.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"Philosophy"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"“Ethics Consultant” is a broad market title rather than one universally regulated profession. Actual requirements vary significantly by sector. Strong domain knowledge in areas such as AI, healthcare, compliance, ESG, research ethics, or corporate governance can substantially improve employability."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Timeline","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Philosophy, logic and ethical reasoning"}],[{"text":"Applied Learning"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Business, technology and professional ethics"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Ethics research, policy and risk"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Ethics/Compliance/Research Associate"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Ethics analysis and policy support"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Ethics consulting and programme management"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Ethics/Responsible Business Consultant"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Ethics/Governance Lead"}],[{"text":"Executive"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Director / Chief Ethics & Governance roles"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":