ations change frequently, so prioritise recognised programmes relevant to the chosen industry rather than collecting generic ethics certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA Philosophy graduate may enter through adjacent roles before reaching the exact title “Ethics Consultant.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible entry roles:"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ethics Research Intern"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Policy Research Assistant"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Ethics Analyst"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Governance Analyst"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"ESG Analyst"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Responsible AI Analyst"},{"text":"Entry/Junior"}],[{"text":"Research Ethics Assistant"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Corporate Responsibility Associate"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Risk & Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Entry"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is ethics?"},{"text":"What is the difference between ethics and compliance?"},{"text":"Explain consequentialism and deontology."},{"text":"How would you analyse an ethical dilemma?"},{"text":"What is a conflict of interest?"},{"text":"How would you identify stakeholders?"},{"text":"What is an ethical risk?"},{"text":"How should a company respond to whistleblowing?"},{"text":"Is an action legal always necessarily ethical?"},{"text":"How would you assess AI bias?"},{"text":"How should companies balance profit and social responsibility?"},{"text":"What is responsible AI?"},{"text":"How would you design an ethics policy?"},{"text":"How would you handle conflicting stakeholder interests?"},{"text":"How would you defend an ethical recommendation to senior management?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate qualification can 